  play triangle cut out of it — chat and video in one glyph. The black ground
  is the adaptive icon's background layer (mipmap-anydpi-v26/ic_launcher.xml →
  @color/us_background), so this foreground carries the glyph alone and reads
  as a monochrome themed icon too. The triangle is an even-odd hole, so the
  ground shows through it. Geometry stays inside the 66dp safe zone of the
  108dp canvas.
-->
